<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Coordinates Application - Pagina Non Trovata</title>
    <script src="/js/others/tailwind.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/font-awesome.css" />
</head>

<body class="bg-gray-50">
    <div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">
        <!-- Main Content -->
        <main class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
            <div class="w-full max-w-md">
                <!-- Error Card -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="p-6 text-center">
                        <div class="flex mb-6 w-full justify-center">
                            <img src="/img/logo.png" class="w-32 rounded-full">
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900">404</h2>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800">Pagina non trovata</p>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600">Ci dispiace, la pagina che stai cercando non esiste o è stata spostata.</p>

                        <div class="mt-6 space-y-3">
                            <a href="/" class="block w-full px-4 py-2 bg-red-600 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-md hover:bg-red-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-purple-500 transition-colors">
                                Torna alla Dashboard
                            </a>
                            <button onclick="window.history.back()" class="block w-full px-4 py-2 bg-white text-gray-700 text-sm font-medium rounded-md border border-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-purple-500 transition-colors">
                                Torna Indietro
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer class="bg-white border-t border-gray-100">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <p class="text-center text-sm text-gray-500">© <script>document.write(new Date().getFullYear())</script> Coordinates Application. Tutti i diritti riservati.</p>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>

</html>